                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "60 years ago today, Medicare & Medicaid were signed into law. These programs are the reason why millions of Americans can access basic health care & live with dignity.\n\nToday, these lifelines are under attack. Trump and Republicans' Big Ugly Law makes the largest cut to Medicaid in history & slashes $500 billion from Medicare. But @HouseDemocrats won\u2019t back down.\n\nWe\u2019ll keep fighting to protect, strengthen & expand health care them for generations to come.",
