                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "From tariffs to the Big Ugly Bill, Trump's policies do the same thing: rip off hardworking Americans to line the pockets of his billionaire buddies.\n\nYou can thank Trump for the higher costs of healthcare, housing, and other essential household items.",
