                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump & Republicans don\u2019t have a health care plan to expand access or lower costs. \n \nTheir law strips coverage from 15 million people, guts clinics that serve Medicaid patients, and punishes providers that offer abortion services. No one sees lower costs, and millions get left without access to primary care, contraception, cancer screenings, or HIV prevention. It's despicable.",
