                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This past week, I joined @popdemoc to call out Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Law, which SLASHES funding for food assistance, education, & kicks 15 MILLION Americans off their health care, all to deliver trillions in tax cuts to billionaires. We'll keep fighting to reverse cuts to Medicaid and the Affordable Care Act & ensure every American can get care.",
