                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "1.1 million Medicaid patients just lost access to cancer screenings, birth control, and STI care at Planned Parenthood. This is a direct result of Trump & Republicans' assault on health care.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nI'm fighting back w/ @ReproCaucus because every patient deserves the right to trusted care.",
