                "text": "At today\u2019s @WaysMeansCmte hearing, I urged Republicans to stop sabotaging the economy and rubber stamping Trump's tariffs, and instead work with Democrats to lower costs, protect health care, & strengthen Medicare & Social Security.\n\nTrump\u2019s economy is failing working families. Republicans are choosing to enable his harmful policies.",
