                "text": "3 months ago, Republicans passed a law that ripped health insurance away from 15 million Americans. Yesterday, they shut down the government rather than fix the crisis they created or lift a finger to stop millions more Americans from losing their coverage when ACA tax credits expire.\n\nNow they are spreading blatant lies about how federal health coverage works in a desperate attempt to distract from how painful it will be for people when their premiums double in cost, when they lose health care altogether, and when their local hospital closes its doors.\n\nWhat Republicans have done to our health care system is reckless and cruel.\n\nDemocrats stand ready to negotiate when Republicans are serious about reversing this damage and protecting working families.",
