                "text": "Republicans care more about hiding the Epstein files than helping the American people.\n\u00a0\nDay 3 of their shutdown: Speaker Johnson just cancelled next week\u2019s votes instead of working to end this shutdown.\u2028\u00a0\nDemocrats are ready to end the crisis, cut costs & protect healthcare.",
