                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today I visited Herald Christian Health Center in Rosemead\u2014a community health center that helps thousands enroll in Medi-Cal and Covered California & provides lifesaving care regardless of income or insurance.\n\nBut Trump & Republicans gutted the programs that make that care possible\u2014slashing Medicaid, weakening the ACA, and kicking 15 million Americans off coverage. And now they\u2019re refusing to extend ACA tax credits, driving up premiums for millions more. Democrats are fighting back.",
