                "text": "A mother of 3 from Upland is already struggling with the high cost of groceries, goods, appliances, and insurance under the Trump admin. Now Republicans are adding $300 more PER MONTH in health care premiums.\n\nFamilies are hurting, and Republicans are only making it worse. https://t.co/zDbHg8c7Ln",
